  "description": "Arctic islands only, and only one colony: on the smallest islet the island has, standing about the shore in a crowd, waddling between rocks, hopping down into the sea to swim fast just off the islet, porpoising clear of the water and diving, then coming back out. They can't fly. Black back and head with a white band over the eye, white front, orange bill and feet; a loud braying call. (In reality they live in the far south; here they've found their way north.)",
